# Full‑Stack Application (Java + React)

This repository contains a full‑stack application built with a **Java (Spring Boot)** backend and a **React** frontend.  
Both frontend and backend reside inside the `src/` directory (`src/frontend` and `src/backend`).

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
root/
│
├── src/
│   ├── backend/             # Spring Boot backend (Java 21, Maven)
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   ├── Dockerfile       # Dedicated Backend Dockerfile (Port 8080)
│   │   └── pom.xml
│   │
│   └── frontend/            # React frontend (Vite, TypeScript)
│       ├── src/
│       ├── Dockerfile       # Dedicated Frontend Dockerfile (Port 3000)
│       └── package.json
│
├── deployment/              # Global CaaS / Kubernetes Helm Packaging
│   ├── Chart.yaml
│   ├── values.yaml          # Defines 2-container app deployment (backend + frontend)
│   ├── .helmignore
│   └── templates/
│       ├── configmap.yaml
│       └── secrets.yaml
│
├── Dockerfile               # Combined multi-stage Docker build
├── build.sh                 # Linux/macOS build script
├── build.bat                # Windows build script
└── README.ME
```

